 "purifier": "'The Purifier: message texts (scenarioText tags). {n} items are filled by the scenario code.\nPurifier Faction Name;The Purifier\nPurifier Dock Name;Ancient Repair Station\nPurifier Choice Title;The Purifier wakes\nPurifier Choice;Your ship at {0} has woken something ancient: a planet destroyer, free of any master. It will destroy the colonies of one race family. Which?\nPurifier Option;Hunt the {0}\nPurifier Sighted Title;The Purifier sighted\nPurifier Sighted;The Purifier, an ancient planet destroyer with its escort, has been sighted at {0}. Hunt it: it strikes a world, then vanishes into deep space.\nPurifier Resighted Title;The Purifier sighted again\nPurifier Resighted;The Purifier has been seen again at {0}.\nPurifier Strike Title;World destroyed\nPurifier Strike;The Purifier has destroyed our colony {0}.\nPurifier Strike News;The Purifier has destroyed {0} in the {1} system.\nPurifier Engaged News;{0} has engaged the Purifier, the ancient planet destroyer that is destroying whole worlds.\nPurifier Exposed News;It is now known that {0} woke the Purifier.\nPurifier Retarget News;With nothing left to destroy, the Purifier has turned on the {0}.\nPurifier Dock Title;The Purifier's station found\nPurifier Dock Found;We have found the ancient repair station at {0}. The Purifier is helpless while docked there.\nPurifier Dock Row;The Purifier's repair station at {0}\nPurifier Dock Status;Ancient station: the Purifier cannot jump, fire or raise shields while it is docked for repair.\nPurifier Site Row Live;The Purifier is at {0}\nPurifier Site Row Seen;The Purifier (last seen near {0}, {1})\nPurifier Status;It has destroyed {0} worlds so far.\nPurifier Bounty Title;The Purifier destroyed\nPurifier Bounty;Your forces destroyed the Purifier. {0} credits of salvage have been paid into the treasury, and the other empires think the better of us.\nPurifier Ended News;The Purifier has been destroyed by {0}. It destroyed {1} worlds.\nPurifier Unknown Slayer;unknown hands\nReputation Cause purifier.waker;You woke the Purifier\nReputation Cause purifier.slayer;Your forces destroyed the Purifier\n",
 "robotmutiny": "'Robot Mutiny: message texts (scenarioText tags). {n} items are filled by the scenario code.\nMutiny Faction Name;The Broadcast\nMutiny Hint Title;Anomalous carrier signal\nMutiny Hint;Our engineers report an anomalous carrier signal buried in our BattleBot troops' firmware. Its origin is unknown.\nMutiny Source Found Title;Transmitter located\nMutiny Source Found;Our agents have traced the anomalous signal to a source on {0}.\nMutiny Trigger Title;The machines mutiny\nMutiny Trigger;Every BattleBot troop in the galaxy has turned at once, answering a hidden broadcast. The Broadcast rises.\nMutiny Trigger News;A hidden broadcast has turned BattleBot troops across the galaxy against their owners. The Broadcast has risen.\nMutiny Defused;{0} has been neutralised, silencing the broadcast before it could wake the mutiny.\nMutiny Contained;The Broadcast has been destroyed. The mutiny is over.\nMutiny Defeat;The Broadcast now holds {0}% of the galaxy's population.\nMutiny Victory Title;The broadcast is silenced\nMutiny Defeat Title;The machines prevail\nMutiny Empire Name;Broadcast Machine Dominion\nMutiny Empire;The Broadcast has taken {0} and proclaimed itself the {1}.\nMutiny Silenced;The transmitter on {0} has been silenced. No more machines will answer the broadcast.\nMutiny Beacon;Warships of unknown make are pouring out of the ruins of {0}, answering the broadcast.\n",
 "silence": "'The Silence: message texts (scenarioText tags). {n} items are filled by the scenario code.\nSilence Zone Name;The Silence\nSilence Zone Message;Hyperdrives fail without warning here. Something on the world below is transmitting.\nSilence Source Row;Silence source (confirmed)\nSilence Start Title;The Silence begins\nSilence Start;A precursor signal from {0} has begun disabling hyperdrives nearby. The zone is growing.\nSilence Shutdown Title;The Silence is shut down\nSilence Shutdown;The signal from {0} has gone quiet. Hyperdrives in the zone work again.\nSilence Victory Title;The Silence is shut down\n",
 "timebomb": "'Time-Bomb Tech: message texts (scenarioText tags). {n} items are filled by the scenario code.\nTimeBomb Faction Name;the precursor lattice\nTimeBomb Detonation Title;Catastrophic resonance failure\nTimeBomb Detonation;{0} has vanished. A cult cell on the colony drove our precursor lattice tech past its failure point and tore the planet apart.\nTimeBomb Detonation News;{0} of the {1} has vanished in a catastrophic resonance failure. Cultists are suspected.\nTimeBomb War Detonation News;The theocracy has claimed the destruction of {0} of the {1}: its cell on the planet set off the precursor lattice as an act of war.\nTimeBomb Hint Title;Anomalous readings\nTimeBomb Hint;Our scientists report the precursor tech salvaged from the ruins carries anomalous resonance readings. They cannot yet explain them.\nTimeBomb Confirmed Title;The lattice is unstable\nTimeBomb Confirmed;Analysis of the detonations is conclusive: the precursor lattice tech has a catastrophic, self-destructive failure mode. Any colony that uses it is at risk.\nTimeBomb Abandoned Title;Precursor tech abandoned\nTimeBomb Abandoned;{0} has abandoned the precursor lattice technology, stripping its bonuses but ending the risk of detonation.\nTimeBomb Contained;No empire, and no cult, still holds the precursor lattice technology. The detonations have stopped.\nTimeBomb Contained Cult;With the cult broken, nobody is left who knows how to set off the precursor lattice. The detonations have stopped.\nTimeBomb Cell Formed;A cult cell has formed on {0}.\nTimeBomb Cell Suspected Title;Cult cell suspected\nTimeBomb Cell Suspected;Our security service suspects a cult cell on {0}, a colony that uses the precursor lattice tech. If the cult knows its failure mode, the planet is at risk.\nTimeBomb Cell Confirmed Title;Cult bomb plot confirmed\nTimeBomb Cell Confirmed;A failed attempt to trigger the precursor lattice on {0} confirms it: a cult cell there is trying to blow up the planet. Purge it.\nTimeBomb Defused Title;Cult cell defused\nTimeBomb Defused;The cult cell on {0} has been broken up ({1} converts turned). The precursor lattice there is safe for now.\nTimeBomb Cult Inherits;{0} has taken the precursor lattice technology with it. The cult now holds the means to destroy planets at will.\nSecurity Kind cultBomb;Cult bomb cell\nReputation Cause timeBomb.cultDetonation;Your cultists destroyed one of our worlds\nTimeBomb Defeat;{0} planets have vanished to the cult's precursor-lattice bombs. The scale of the loss cannot be undone.\nTimeBomb Victory Title;The lattice is abandoned\nTimeBomb Defeat Title;The lattice claims its price\n",
 "void-whale": "'Void Whale: message texts (scenarioText tags). {n} items are filled by the scenario code.\nVoidWhale Swallowed;A void whale has swallowed {0} at {1}, then leapt away toward the {2}.\nVoidWhale Lost Title;Station swallowed\nVoidWhale Lost;The {0} at {1} has been swallowed by the void whale and is lost with all hands.\nVoidWhale Wounded;The void whale, badly wounded, has fled into deep space. It will return.\nVoidWhale Returns;The wounded void whale has returned, hunting {0}.\nVoidWhale Bounty Title;Void whale slain\nVoidWhale Bounty;Your forces landed the killing blow on the void whale. The bounty of {0} credits has been paid into the treasury, and every other empire thinks the better of us for it.\nVoidWhale Slain;{0} has slain the void whale. Its carcass drifts in space.\nVoidWhale Unknown Slayer;Unknown hands\nVoidWhale Carcass Part;Void whale carcass {0}\nVoidWhale Carcass Design;Carcass\nReputation Cause voidWhale.slayer;Slew the void whale\n"
